        "Extract balances: cash N86,500, motor van N450,000, debtors N132,000, purchases N310,000 and salaries N95,000 on the debit; capital N600,000, sales N380,000 and creditors N93,500 on the credit. Both columns total N1,073,500, so the trial balance agrees. If salaries had been posted N95,000 to the wrong side only, a difference of N190,000 would expose the error immediately, illustrating why extraction care is examined so heavily in {S}.",
